{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":15039,\"date\":\"2026-05-21T09:44:21+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-21T06:47:14+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-didascalie-automatiche-video-personali-iphone\",\"title\":\"iOS 27: didascalie automatiche per i video personali su iPhone\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple anticipa nuove funzioni di accessibilità: iOS 27 può generare automaticamente didascalie per i video personali, con supporto iniziale in inglese.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Says-iOS-27-Can-Automatically-Add-Captions-to-Your-Personal-iPhone-Videos-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Says-iOS-27-Can-Automatically-Add-Captions-to-Your-Personal-iPhone-Videos-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15037,\"date\":\"2026-05-21T08:30:11+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-21T06:46:46+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-voice-control-linguaggio-naturale-upgrade-apple-intelligence\",\"title\":\"iOS 27: Voice Control con linguaggio naturale e upgrade Apple Intelligence\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple aggiorna Voice Control su iPhone e iPad con supporto al linguaggio naturale tramite Apple Intelligence. Funzione disponibile inizialmente in inglese in alcuni Paesi.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iOS-27s-New-AI-Voice-Control-Feature-Hints-at-Major-Siri-Upgrade-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27s-New-AI-Voice-Control-Feature-Hints-at-Major-Siri-Upgrade-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15019,\"date\":\"2026-05-20T18:30:19+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-20T09:59:44+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-nuove-funzioni-accessibilita-apple-intelligence\",\"title\":\"Apple anticipa nuove funzioni di accessibilità con Apple Intelligence\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple annuncia aggiornamenti accessibilità basati su Apple Intelligence per VoiceOver, Magnifier, Voice Control e Accessibility Reader, con sottotitoli generati e controllo carrozzina su Vision Pro.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iOS-27-Accessibility-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27-Accessibility-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":5,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14974,\"date\":\"2026-05-19T14:30:26+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-19T08:06:38+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-programma-wwdc-2026-inviti-media\",\"title\":\"Apple pubblica il programma di WWDC 2026 e invia inviti ai media\",\"excerpt\":\"WWDC 2026 si terrà dal 8 al 12 giugno. La keynote inizierà alle 10:00 PT (1:00 ET) e sarà disponibile in streaming su Apple.com, Apple TV e YouTube.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/wwdc-apple-park-in-person-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"wwdc-apple-park-in-person\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14972,\"date\":\"2026-05-19T13:00:18+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-19T08:06:44+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-design-awards-2026-finalisti-wwdc-2026\",\"title\":\"Apple annuncia i finalisti degli Apple Design Awards 2026 prima di WWDC\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha comunicato i finalisti degli Apple Design Awards 2026 in vista della WWDC 2026, in programma dal 8 giugno. I vincitori saranno annunciati durante l’evento.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/apple-design-awards-finalists-2026-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-design-awards-finalists-2026\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14970,\"date\":\"2026-05-19T12:00:06+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-19T08:05:37+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-espande-strumenti-scrittura-correttore-grammaticale-ios-27\",\"title\":\"Apple amplia gli strumenti di scrittura con un correttore grammaticale in iOS 27\",\"excerpt\":\"In iOS 27 Apple sta testando Writing Tools più avanzati, con riscrittura e generazione di testo, oltre a un correttore grammaticale dedicato simile a Grammarly.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/apple-intelligence-black-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-intelligence-black\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14968,\"date\":\"2026-05-19T11:00:57+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-19T08:05:49+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-generatori-wallpaper-scorciatoie-ai\",\"title\":\"iOS 27: generatori di wallpaper e scorciatoie create con AI\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Bloomberg, iOS 27 introdurrà un generatore di wallpaper personalizzati tramite Image Playground e un aggiornamento di Shortcuts con creazione automatica basata su AI.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios-games\",\"categoryId\":103,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iOS-27-Mock-Quick-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27-Mock-Quick\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14957,\"date\":\"2026-05-18T09:30:23+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-19T08:05:05+00:00\",\"slug\":\"suggested-genmoji-arrivo-ios-27\",\"title\":\"“Suggested Genmoji” in arrivo su iPhone con iOS 27\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Mark Gurman, Apple sta lavorando a iOS 27 per migliorare i Genmoji e introdurre “Suggested Genmoji”, idee emoji personalizzate basate su foto e frasi digitate spesso.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/macOS-Sequoia-Genmoji-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-Sequoia-Genmoji-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14865,\"date\":\"2026-05-14T12:45:44+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-14T08:54:01+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-piano-app-ai-agent-app-store\",\"title\":\"Apple lavora a un piano per consentire app con AI agent su App Store\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo The Information, Apple sta progettando un sistema per supportare app con AI agent e funzioni di AI coding su App Store, mantenendo sicurezza e privacy.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Liquid-Glass-App-Store-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Liquid-Glass-App-Store-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":5,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14763,\"date\":\"2026-05-11T08:15:05+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-11T06:15:05+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-27-nuove-modifiche-design-organize-tabs\",\"title\":\"macOS 27: nuove modifiche al design e opzione “Organize Tabs”\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Bloomberg, macOS 27 avrà un leggero redesign rispetto a macOS Tahoe e una funzione AI in Safari per raggruppare automaticamente le schede.\",\"categoryName\":\"macOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"macos\",\"categoryId\":100,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/MacBook-Pro-Low-Angle-Wide-Lens-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"MacBook-Pro-Low-Angle-Wide-Lens\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14730,\"date\":\"2026-05-09T09:51:58+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-09T07:51:58+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-watch-series-12-watchos-27-cosa-aspettarsi\",\"title\":\"Apple Watch Series 12 e watchOS 27: cosa aspettarsi\",\"excerpt\":\"Rumor su Touch ID, nuovi chip, nuove watch face e funzioni Apple Intelligence e satellite in watchOS 27, con lancio atteso a settembre.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Watch-Series-10-Jet-Black-Touch-ID-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Watch-Series-10-Jet-Black-Touch-ID\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14584,\"date\":\"2026-05-05T12:51:37+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-05T10:51:37+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-crea-pass-personalizzati-apple-wallet\",\"title\":\"iOS 27: crea pass personalizzati in Apple Wallet\",\"excerpt\":\"In iOS 27 arriva l’opzione “Create a Pass” in Apple Wallet: scansione QR per pass compatibili e creazione di pass personalizzati quando non c’è un codice.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iOS-26-Wallet-Glass-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-26-Wallet-Glass-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14567,\"date\":\"2026-05-04T10:24:29+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-04T08:24:29+00:00\",\"slug\":\"quando-aspettarsi-ipad-12-con-apple-intelligence-2\",\"title\":\"Quando aspettarsi iPad 12 con Apple Intelligence\",\"excerpt\":\"Un commento del CFO Apple Kevan Parekh suggerisce che iPad 12 con supporto Apple Intelligence non sia previsto nel trimestre fiscale fino al 27 giugno.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPad\",\"categorySlug\":\"ipad\",\"categoryId\":10,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iPad-A16-Colors-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iPad-A16-Colors\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14543,\"date\":\"2026-05-03T20:52:14+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-03T18:52:14+00:00\",\"slug\":\"quando-aspettarsi-ipad-12-con-apple-intelligence\",\"title\":\"Quando aspettarsi iPad 12 con Apple Intelligence\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo un commento del CFO Apple Kevan Parekh, l’iPad 12 entry-level con supporto Apple Intelligence potrebbe arrivare solo dopo il trimestre fiscale in corso.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPad\",\"categorySlug\":\"ipad\",\"categoryId\":10,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iPad-A16-Colors-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iPad-A16-Colors\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14531,\"date\":\"2026-05-03T20:51:23+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-03T18:51:23+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-27-nuove-funzioni-siri-interfaccia-touch-stabilita\",\"title\":\"macOS 27: nuove funzioni Siri, interfaccia touch e più stabilità\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo le indiscrezioni, macOS 27 arriverà a settembre dopo beta a giugno e luglio: app Siri dedicata, funzioni Apple Intelligence, ottimizzazioni touch e stop al supporto AFP.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/macOS-27-on-MacBook-Pro-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-27-on-MacBook-Pro\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14437,\"date\":\"2026-04-25T12:32:30+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-25T10:32:30+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-12gb-ram\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 potrebbe arrivare a 12GB di RAM\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo l’analista Dan Nystedt, l’iPhone 18 base potrebbe passare per la prima volta a 12GB di RAM, allineandosi ai modelli Pro dello scorso anno.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/apple-silicon-feature-joeblue-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-silicon-feature-joeblue\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14347,\"date\":\"2026-04-19T16:02:45+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-19T14:02:45+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-27-fine-era-intel-solo-apple-silicon\",\"title\":\"macOS 27: fine dell’era Intel, solo Apple silicon\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha indicato che macOS 27 sarà compatibile solo con Mac Apple silicon. macOS 26 Tahoe sarà l’ultima versione principale per i Mac Intel.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/macOS-27-on-MacBook-Pro-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-27-on-MacBook-Pro\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14318,\"date\":\"2026-04-18T13:32:07+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-18T11:32:07+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-nuove-funzioni-oltre-siri-satellite-apple-intelligence\",\"title\":\"iOS 27: nuove funzioni oltre Siri, tra satellite e Apple Intelligence\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo i rumor, iOS 27 arriverà a settembre dopo il keynote WWDC 2026 del 8 giugno e introdurrà novità su connettività satellitare, Liquid Glass e Apple Intelligence.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/iOS-27-on-iPhone-17-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27-on-iPhone-17-1\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14308,\"date\":\"2026-04-18T12:53:38+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-18T10:53:38+00:00\",\"slug\":\"mac-studio-2026-5-cose-da-sapere-prossimo-modello\",\"title\":\"Mac Studio 2026: 5+ cose da sapere sul prossimo modello\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple starebbe lavorando a un aggiornamento del Mac Studio nel 2026. Ecco cosa indicano i rumor su design, chip, SSD, RAM, disponibilità e tempistiche.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/mac-studio-green-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"mac-studio-green\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14106,\"date\":\"2026-04-02T13:26:52+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-02T11:26:52+00:00\",\"slug\":\"siri-in-ios-27-tutto-quello-che-sappiamo\",\"title\":\"Siri in iOS 27: tutto quello che sappiamo (rumor)\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo i rumor, iOS 27, iPadOS 27 e macOS 27 introdurranno una Siri riprogettata come chatbot, con app dedicata, integrazione di sistema e nuove funzioni basate su Gemini.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/iOS-27-and-Siri-Finder-Thumb-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27-and-Siri-Finder-Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14089,\"date\":\"2026-03-30T21:22:53+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-03-30T19:22:55+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-trasforma-siri-in-un-hub-ai-cosa-sono-le-extensions-e-perche-cambiano-tutto\",\"title\":\"iOS 27 trasforma Siri in un hub AI: cosa sono le Extensions e perché cambiano tutto\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple si prepara a ridefinire il ruolo di Siri. Con iOS 27, l’assistente vocale potrebbe evolversi da sistema chiuso a piattaforma aperta, capace di integrare intelligenze artificiali esterne come Google Gemini o Claude attraverso un nuovo sistema chiamato Extensions. In questo scenario, Siri non sarebbe più limitato alle proprie capacità, ma diventerebbe un punto di…\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/03/Nuova-versione-di-Siri-768x432.webp\",\"imageAlt\":\"Nuova-versione-di-Siri\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14057,\"date\":\"2026-03-26T21:33:08+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-03-26T20:33:08+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-chatbot-ai-terze-parti-integrabili-con-siri-in-ios-27\",\"title\":\"Apple: chatbot AI di terze parti integrabili con Siri in iOS 27\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Bloomberg, Apple in iOS 27 permetterà l’integrazione di chatbot AI di terze parti con Siri, espandendo l’attuale collaborazione con OpenAI/ChatGPT.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/03/Gemini-Siri-Feature-768x432.jpg\"